ProxyOS: Complete Build
Architecture Overview
Frontend (Next.js + Phaser.js)
•	Premium Apple-grade UI with frosted glass aesthetics
•	Real-time pixel-art office visualization
•	Progressive Web App deployment on Vercel
Backend (Hugging Face Docker Space)
•	OpenClaw agent swarm with lane-queue system
