System Features
Real-time Synchronization
•	Supabase WebSockets push agent status updates instantly to the Phaser.js canvas
•	When Minion deploys code, you see typing animations and success checkmarks
•	No page refresh required
Persistent Memory
•	Hugging Face Space pulls memories from Supabase on boot
•	Agents never forget previous work
•	Memory vault allows inspection of agent “brains”
Gamification
•	Energy system increases as you feed context
•	Level progression based on completed tasks
•	Visual feedback for all actions
Autonomous Execution
•	Lane-queue system prevents task-clashing
•	Background cron processes tasks every 10 seconds
•	Auto-delegation based on content analysis
Premium UI
•	Frosted glass aesthetics throughout
•	120fps animations via Framer Motion
•	Phaser.js pixel-art office with dynamic lighting
•	Fully responsive PWA design
The system is now fully functional. You can feed context via voice or text, watch your Proxy delegate to the three agents in the pixel office, and monitor real-time execution with zero hosting costs.
 
