PART 6: RISK MITIGATION
Known Issues & Solutions
Risk	Probability	Impact	Mitigation
Hugging Face cold start	High	5-10s delay	Add “Waking up…” animation
Groq rate limit	Medium	Task fails	Circuit breaker → Gemini fallback
Supabase realtime disconnect	Medium	Stale UI	Auto-reconnect with backoff
Mobile WebGL unsupported	Low	3D fails	Graceful 2D fallback
Browser storage full	Low	PWA breaks	LRU cache eviction
API key exposure	Low	Security breach	Environment variables + RLS
